- Phase 4 handoff is **mandatory** AND fires ONLY after ALL feature PRDs + Phase 3 outputs (`INDEX.md`, `nav-graph.mmd`) are on disk. Never trigger mid-loop. Offers "Run design" (auto-chains to `kta-design-spec` with PRD dir), "Pick feature" (single-PRD design run), or "Exit to read"
