| 5 | noise-05-plasma | Plasma | sin sums | `sin(uv.x*10+t)+sin(uv.y*10+t)+sin(length(uv)*10)` |
| 6 | noise-06-warped-lava | Warped Lava | domain warping | `fbm(p + fbm(p + fbm(p)))` colored as fire |

