# Phase 06 — Category D: RenderEffect Post-Processing on Composables

## Context Links
- `plan.md`
- `phase-02-lesson-framework.md` (uses `AgslCanvas` RenderEffect mode)
- `phase-05-category-c-noise.md` (dissolve + displacement reuse `NOISE_HELPERS`)
